00:00:11.978 --> 00:00:13.646 align:start size:94% position:6%
But you have
a connection with him.

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:16.049 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is a true story.
-This is a very true story.

00:00:16.049 --> 00:00:17.117 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I would not believe this
if there wasn´t --

00:00:17.117 --> 00:00:20.286 align:start size:94% position:6%
