00:00:22.756 --> 00:00:24.624 align:start size:94% position:6%
that I´m about
to show the audience.

00:00:24.624 --> 00:00:27.060 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It´s an ultrasound,
a little orange ultrasound.

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:30.196
-You went to jury duty.
-I got called in for jury duty.

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:31.965 align:start size:94% position:6%
I had postponed it
a couple times,

00:00:31.965 --> 00:00:34.100 align:start size:94% position:6%
and this was the last time,
so I had to go.

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:35.135 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And he was there.

00:00:35.135 --> 00:00:36.469 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He was there.

00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:38.571 align:start size:94% position:6%
When I showed up, there was
all these things there.

00:00:38.571 --> 00:00:40.640
I´m like, "Am I about to go on,
like, a murder trial?

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:42.075 align:start size:94% position:6%
What´s happening?"

00:00:42.075 --> 00:00:44.611 align:start size:94% position:6%
And this happened.
-And there he is. Look at him.

00:00:44.611 --> 00:00:47.113
I mean, that´s definitely him.
-I took a little creeper photo.

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:49.616 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-And that´s him.

00:00:49.616 --> 00:00:52.218 align:start size:94% position:6%
He specifically asked to sit
between those two ladies.

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:54.254 align:start size:94% position:6%
Got his picture taken.
-Yeah.

00:00:54.254 --> 00:00:56.189 align:start size:94% position:6%
Got his picture taken
and then got up and left.

00:00:56.189 --> 00:00:57.791 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, he didn´t stay?
-Oh, no.

00:00:57.791 --> 00:01:00.827 align:start size:94% position:6%
He was there for maybe
a half an hour,

00:01:00.827 --> 00:01:02.729 size:78% position:39%
as long as it took to
take the pictures...

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:04.531 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Got it.
-...make a couple weird jokes.

00:01:04.531 --> 00:01:06.866 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, like, make it --
´Cause I was gonna say, like,

00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:09.002 align:start size:94% position:6%
