00:01:21.448 --> 00:01:22.615
It was like a couple days later,

00:01:22.615 --> 00:01:23.950 align:start size:94% position:6%
so I think he felt
he had to be there.

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:25.452 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, he basically said
to the judge --

00:01:25.452 --> 00:01:27.287
It´s like, "Is there any reason
