00:01:27.287 --> 00:01:29.989 align:start size:94% position:6%
He´s like,
"I´m gonna be president."

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:33.059 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"I´m gonna be president.
It´s gonna be great."

00:01:33.059 --> 00:01:34.561 align:start size:94% position:6%
God, I never --
I should have done Trump.

00:01:34.561 --> 00:01:35.562 size:75% position:38%
What was I thinking?

00:01:35.562 --> 00:01:36.596 align:start size:94% position:6%
I should have done
Trump on "SNL"

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:37.430 size:84% position:42%
-This is very exciting.

00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:39.165
Your show, "Me, Myself &amp; I" --

00:01:39.165 --> 00:01:41.768 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is a very interesting
premise for a show.

00:01:41.768 --> 00:01:43.937 align:start size:94% position:6%
You, John Larroquette,
and a younger actor

00:01:43.937 --> 00:01:45.939
