different points in their lives.

00:01:45.939 --> 00:01:48.408
-Yeah, Jack Dylan Grazer.
He´s in "It" right now.

00:01:48.408 --> 00:01:51.878
Plays me at 14.
It´s three different timelines.

00:01:51.878 --> 00:01:53.613
You see me at 14, in 1991,

00:01:53.613 --> 00:01:58.084 align:start size:94% position:6%
at 40 years old, in 2017,
and at 65 years old, in 2042,

00:01:58.084 --> 00:01:59.419
played by John Larroquette.

00:01:59.419 --> 00:02:01.454 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And have you enjoyed
the difference in schedule of,

00:02:01.454 --> 00:02:04.257
