versus the "SNL" grind?

00:02:04.257 --> 00:02:05.425 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Very much so.

00:02:05.425 --> 00:02:07.560 align:start size:94% position:6%
My first day at
"Me, Myself &amp; I,"

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:11.164
I was in every single scene,
and it was like a 12-hour day.

00:02:11.164 --> 00:02:13.833 align:start size:94% position:6%
And they were like,
"We are so sorry.

00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:15.001 align:start size:94% position:6%
We apologize."

00:02:15.001 --> 00:02:16.970 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like, "This is like
a half day for me.

00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:19.272
I was like, "This is the
easiest schedule in the world."

00:02:19.272 --> 00:02:21.708 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like,
"No, it´s the best," yeah.

00:02:21.708 --> 00:02:24.911 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You also had one of
the highlights of your life?

00:02:24.911 --> 00:02:26.112 align:start size:94% position:6%
You got to work
with some people.

00:02:26.112 --> 00:02:27.313 align:start size:94% position:6%
You´re very --
I don´t even know.

00:02:27.313 --> 00:02:28.648 align:start size:94% position:6%
