I had a daughter.

00:02:31.484 --> 00:02:33.052
-Yeah. Like, not that far ago.

00:02:33.052 --> 00:02:35.922 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But it really
was the best weekend.

00:02:35.922 --> 00:02:38.458 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You did The Muppets
at Hollywood Bowl

00:02:38.458 --> 00:02:40.193 align:start size:94% position:6%
and you got to work with
The Muppets.

00:02:40.193 --> 00:02:42.762
-I got to host "The Muppet Show"
