00:02:42.762 --> 00:02:47.934 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There you go.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:47.934 --> 00:02:50.236
How -- Was it outstanding?

00:02:50.236 --> 00:02:51.304 align:start size:94% position:6%
