00:03:00.113 --> 00:03:02.649 size:78% position:39%
It was truly amazing.

00:03:02.649 --> 00:03:04.050 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was the best.
It was the best.

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:05.451 align:start size:94% position:6%
I got to sing
"Rainbow Connection"

00:03:05.451 --> 00:03:06.686
