00:03:06.686 --> 00:03:08.488 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, that´s fantastic.
-Oh, he´s the best.

00:03:08.488 --> 00:03:09.822
-If you´re gonna sing it with
anyone, those are the guys.

00:03:09.822 --> 00:03:11.524 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Correct, correct. Yeah.
I miss them.

00:03:11.524 --> 00:03:14.394 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, congratulations.
Congratulations on everything.

00:03:14.394 --> 00:03:16.829 align:start size:94% position:6%
